From cd56e1b5d8229cbbbb7b1cbdc0ce1dbba445e3b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 10:36:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] Add physics-audit test suite (ctest): tests/ registered
 in CMakeLists.txt

Ten CTest targets (option CMPMC_BUILD_TESTS, default ON) that compare CMPMC
against closed forms, independent numerics and the literature/campaign values:
anharmonic decay kinematics and energy PDFs (Leman 1109.1193 Eqs. (9)-(14)),
Christoffel velocities and LUT errors, presets vs G4CMP CrystalMaps and
2408.04732 / campaign WP5-v4, WP8-R values, isotope B rebuilt from isotope
abundances, rate laws, Luke rate/angles/l0 vs Leman Eqs. (21)-(22) and Table II,
NTL energy closure (campaign WP7-E-v3 (E11)) and step convergence, HV valley
covariance and IV rate forms, Fano sampler moments and (W4) partition
bookkeeping, Kaplan samplers / eta_pb vs WP5-v4 (W13) and 1401.1937 / surrogate
table, G4CMP surface branching, and a header/energy-conservation smoke test.
Run: cmake -B build && cmake --build build && (cd build && ctest).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BcNoovRae5kkbL36KL3sYy
